
# 🔎 Digital Lost & Found System

> **Find what's Lost. Return what's Found.**

A secure and user-friendly **Digital Lost & Found System** designed to help users report lost or found items, search available records, and reconnect belongings with their rightful owners.

The platform provides a centralized environment for managing lost and found items while focusing on **security, privacy, and easy communication**.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 🔐 Secure Authentication

* User registration and login
* Secure authentication using JWT
* Verified users can manage their lost/found claims
* Helps prevent unauthorized access

### 📢 Report Lost Items

Users can report items they have lost by providing relevant information about the item.

### 📦 Report Found Items

Users who discover a lost item can submit its details to help the owner recover it.

### 🔎 Search Database

Users can browse and search the lost and found database to identify matching items.

### 💬 Private Messaging

Users can communicate securely without exposing personal contact information such as phone numbers or email addresses.

### 📸 Evidence Upload

Photographic evidence can be uploaded to help identify and verify lost or found items.

### 🛡️ Privacy & Security

The system is designed so that user information remains private until communication is approved.

### ⚡ Real-Time Records

Lost and found records are synchronized with the database to provide updated information.

